<!--
  Deliberate binary breaks against 3.0.0-alpha.495; consumers must rebuild.
  The four Error.NotFound.For/Error.Gone.For entries preserve the previously approved
  trailing optional code parameter change from alpha.496. Overloading was unsafe
  because existing string IDs could otherwise bind as reason codes.

  Typed pagination replaces Cursor, PageSize and Page<T> structs with validated
  reference records, replaces key-specific page assembly with a cursor selector,
  requires parsable scalar encodings and makes the page-size policy explicit.
  Existing unversioned cursor tokens are intentionally invalidated.
-->
